Subject: [PATCH 24/24] cxgb4: cudbg stability fixes

- This patch adds specific ioctl support to showcontext/reg/qdesc
- fixes the panic while collecting sge context
- fixes sge stuck issue due to sge_context_size
- Use the PM_RX specific handler pmrx_intr_handler() for F_PM_RX interrupts
- Do not create l2t debugfs if l2t_data is not assigned
